      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_678538e40db56a61e9486b50367e29c01512f1fe09cc580f2dce85de1a21824d"
      ],
      "text": "The Eat mode reportedly updates a persistent fridge state after cooking, and the demo notes a unit-mismatch issue causing unusual milk quantity values."
    },
